{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"fish_carried_catfish","model_identifier":"fish_carried_catfish","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## fish_carried_catfish\n\nCarried load, fish.\n\n- Cubes: 9 (2 rotated). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.3..12.3, y -1.5..8.5, z -29.3..38.0 (size 15.6 x 10.0 x 67.3 u = 44 x 28 x 189 cm).\nCarried giant catfish (1.8 m, 64 u nose to tail with whiskers): slung over the right shoulder like a log, wide flat head forward (-Z), dark mottled grey-green with a pale belly and long thin-cube whiskers (two rotated). Origin = **slot_shoulder_r** (top of the right shoulder): the load rests on the shoulder (bottom at y = 0) and lies along Z, balanced over the slot, its centre ~2.5 u outboard of the slot so it clears the head.\n"},"description":"## fish_carried_catfish\n\nCarried load, fish.\n\n- Cubes: 9 (2 rotated). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.3..12.3, y -1.5..8.5, z -29.3..38.0 (size 15.6 x 10.0 x 67.3 u = 44 x 28 x 189 cm).\nCarried giant catfish (1.8 m, 64 u nose to tail with whiskers): slung over the right shoulder like a log, wide flat head forward (-Z), dark mottled grey-green with a pale belly and long thin-cube whiskers (two rotated). Origin = **slot_shoulder_r** (top of the right shoulder): the load rests on the shoulder (bottom at y = 0) and lies along Z, balanced over the slot, its centre ~2.5 u outboard of the slot so it clears the head.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"head","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[0.0,-1.0,-22.0],"to":[9.0,4.0,-12.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[72,26,81.0,31.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[52,26,62.0,31.0],"texture